.TH WAVE-LINK 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-link \- Create a versionless shortcut, or re-point it at another installed version. Installs and uninstalls keep it up to date afterwards.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave link <package>[@<version>] | wave link \-\-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a versionless shortcut, or re-point it at another installed
version. Installs and uninstalls keep it up to date afterwards.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-all, \-a
Apply to every installed package

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave link jq
wave link ffmpeg@6.1
wave link --all
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
